# Rule activation map

Parent: [change-control-manifest.mdc](./change-control-manifest.mdc) · Architecture: [ARCHITECTURE.md](../ARCHITECTURE.md)

## Tier 0 — Always-on (every turn)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `change-control-manifest.mdc` | Sequence 1–10, attempt ledger, patch budget, skill routing |
| `bilingual-th-en.mdc` | Thai ~60% / English ~40% replies |
| `workflow/vault-autolog.mdc` | Daily bullet after verified patch |

## Tier 1 — Scoped (auto when editing matching globs)

| File / folder | Triggers on |
|---------------|-------------|
| `clean-code.mdc` | App source `**/*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx,html,css,py,go,…}` |
| `core/` | Same app globs |
| `debugging/` | Same app globs |
| `patching/` | Same app globs |
| `architecture/` | API routes, schema, shared modules |
| `testing/` | App source + `*.{test,spec}.*` |

## Tier 2 — On request (agent-requestable)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `risk/rollback-awareness.mdc` | Reversible changes |
| `risk/risk-classification.mdc` | LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH |
| `risk/approval-gates.mdc` | Human approval for HIGH |
| `workflow/stop-conditions.mdc` | Escalate instead of guessing |
| `core/uncertainty-control.mdc` | Stop when confidence low |

## Tier 3 — On skill invoke

Deep workflow lives in skill `reference.md` (debug mantra, builder close-out, vault schemas).

**Do not** duplicate manifest sequence in scoped rules — link only.
